figured corpus root instead of trusting absolute stored paths\n- emit the two reviewed S23/63 Q4 mark-scheme methods as distinct ordered branch chains with explicit alternative linkage\n- make the P6-02 readback a manifest-bound, atomically materialized supplemental output\n- regenerate only the current P6-02 delta, ledger, cumulative projection, active manifest, and readback; predecessor bytes remain unchanged\n\n## Visual and semantic evidence\n\n- directly reopened and raw-byte authenticated all 13 repair QP/MS pixels\n- preserved 286 Questions / 920 QuestionParts\n- family terminal statuses remain 55 approved / 2 candidate / 4 rejected / 22 abstain\n- all acceptance hard-gate counters are zero\n- deterministic double replay is byte-identical with the expected cache/raw-auth profile on both runs\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1800_p6_linear_combinations_semantic_kg.test.py` — 13/13 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` — 31/31 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1785_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` — 27/27 PASS\n- `python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/future_semantic_kg_producer.py scripts/vlm/issue_1800_p6_linear_combinations_semantic_kg.py` — PASS\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — healthy; only expected task-branch dirty/no-upstream warnings before commit/push\n- `npm run lint:changed` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- predecessor raw-byte authentication — PASS\n- manifest output-custody and zero-hard-gate checks — PASS","created_at":"2026-07-31T12:10:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T12:47:50Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T12:42:02Z","merged_at":"2026-07-31T12:42:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"d107cb9647c19ba860fa4c1babd5bf87b2ec429c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1808/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.